  "_legend": "Waystation on the landward street, Provisioner two rows lower where the ground drops. Tidal flats west, cut by sandbars and standing water; deep bay east; the plank pier and its quay running south to the Bastion.",
  "_plan": "One road reaches the edge, north to Route 4, because Brackwater is the end of the road -- past it there is only water. The landward street stops where the ground gives out into the flats at one end and at the Provisioner door at the other; the lower lane runs from the slipway to the net loft. The strand carries the whole coast, so the pier has a quay to stand on rather than beginning in mid-air."
